Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 05:37:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] VideoRenderers, LICENSES: GPL-2.0-or-later for the Kodi files
 of the Dolby Vision output that may be

Outside tools/dvbridge, six files of the Dolby Vision output said
GPL-3.0-or-later. Four now say GPL-2.0-or-later; only their header
changes (each file without its comments is the same, gcc -fpreprocessed):

- DVBridgeGLES.cpp and DVBridgeGLES.h, the Kodi bridge of CroqueMr's
  Dolby Vision fork of LibreELEC (kodi-9990-native-dv), with the changes
  of Hades. Its author offers "Original Kodi bridge" under
  GPL-2.0-or-later, notices only (CB1/docs/ADAPTER-MIGRATION.md of
  github.com/CroqueMr/libreelec-x86-DV, read at main 572faa4054e8), and
  his own copies of these files say GPL-2.0-or-later. Besides the
  fork's own lines, blame gives them a few lines of the fork's changes
  to WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp (a Kodi file, GPL-2.0-or-later), and
  the diagnostics adapted in 28e8488 came from a fork patch that was
  GPL-2.0-or-later already. The header now says where they come from
  and gives the copyright of Hades for its changes.
- DVBridgeShaders.h.in, the wrapper that puts the two shaders of
  tools/dvbridge into a header ("generated-source wrapper", in the same
  offer; Hades did not change it): its header says where it comes from.
- HwDecRender/DVViewGeometry.h, written by Hades: its SPDX line.

DVBridgeState.cpp and DVBridgeState.h stay GPL-3.0-or-later, unchanged.
80 of the 425 lines of the .cpp and 30 of the 136 of the .h are still
those of the fork's first version (v0.1.0-rc1): the class and its
Property record, the save() lambda of Capture() with the copy of a
blob, the list of the properties it saves, the check that no other
plane is on the CRTC, and Stage(). The documents of the offer list
DVBridgeState.cpp/.h as replaced ("Replacement GPL-2.0-or-later
transaction and property-plan implementation"), not as offered, so
Hades does not change their licence.

LICENSES/README.md says so: the DVBridge helpers of tools/dvbridge and
of xbmc are GPL-2.0-or-later but for those two files, and the build that
includes them is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later.
---
 LICENSES/README.md                                | 15 ++++++++-------
 .../VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/DVBridgeGLES.cpp   | 11 ++++++++++-
 .../VideoPlayer/VideoRenderers/DVBridgeGLES.h     | 11 ++++++++++-
 .../VideoRenderers/DVBridgeShaders.h.in           | 10 +++++++++-
 .../VideoRenderers/HwDecRender/DVViewGeometry.h   |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

